{"id":"wb-3-131","name":"花戏楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"花戏楼","text":"花戏楼，位于安徽省亳州市谯城区咸宁街，原为山陕会馆、大关帝庙，现中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位。\n花戏楼最初为大关帝庙，亦为清朝乾隆年间，山西、陕西两省药商在亳州为了行李往来相互照应所建立的会馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%B1%E6%88%8F%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":92171235,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92171235","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6580fe54c1778dff945b4b50.jpg","title":"20260210_Huaxilou_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260210_Huaxilou_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/20260210_Huaxilou_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​亳州 花戏楼","width":320,"height":213}}